This is Axcient's fork of the FreeBSD Ports Collection.  Proprietary FreeBSD
ports are stored here.

Sync procedure
==============

This repository should be kept in sync with upstream
(https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-ports).  The procedure to do that is:

```sh
git checkout main
git pull origin main
git fetch upstream main
git merge upstream/main
git push origin main
```

Under no circumstances cherry-pick from upstream/main to main!  That will
break merge history, because git is incapable of tracking the source of a
cherry-pick.

Local changes
=============

Local changes may be made as usual.  Either push directly to the main branch,
or make a pull request from another.

The Staging Branch
==================

The "staging" branch, previously used to test new versions of Replibit ports,
is retired.  Do not use it for any purpose.
